From 20392d27a54a04f6a35e5288e5d27b4d60679a2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaeliGlow <caeliglow@mockifylab.local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 09:46:25 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] caeliglow: bar hover opens the widget panel (replaces
 icon-zoom pop)

Hovering any bar widget now opens the panel bound to that widget's
left-click gesture (panel-toggle), with a 140ms dwell guard and a
close-on-leave grace. Generic and config-driven, so built-in, user and
plugin widgets all follow the same rule; per-item widgets stay inert.
Hover only auto-closes a panel it opened (ownership), so it never fights
click- or edge-opened panels. Removes the 0001 kWidgetHoverPopScale pop.
